---
import Layout from '../../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import PageHero from '../../../components/PageHero.astro';
import CTA from '../../../components/CTA.astro';
---
<Layout title="Employment Lawyer in Barcelona | Spain" description="Employment law advice in Barcelona and Spain for dismissals, severance, salary claims, workplace accidents and companies. English-language enquiries welcome.">
<PageHero eyebrow="Employment law" title="Employment lawyer in Barcelona: start with the problem you need to solve." description="We advise employees and companies on dismissals, severance, unpaid salary, workplace issues and preventive employment decisions in Spain." primaryLabel="Contact the firm" primaryHref="/en/contact" secondaryLabel="I have been dismissed" secondaryHref="/en/employment-dismissal" note="Barcelona · Spain · In person and online" />
<section class="section section-paper"><div class="container cards">
<a class="card card-featured" href="/en/employment-dismissal"><div><span class="card-kicker">Urgent</span><h2>Dismissal</h2><p>Review the dismissal letter, notification date, settlement, severance and the next step.</p></div><span class="link-arrow">Employment dismissal lawyer →</span></a>
<a class="card" href="/en/employment-severance"><div><span class="card-kicker">Money</span><h2>Severance and compensation</h2><p>Check the employment history, salary basis, termination type and figures offered.</p></div><span class="link-arrow">Review severance →</span></a>
<a class="card" href="/en/employment-salary-claims"><div><span class="card-kicker">Amounts</span><h2>Unpaid salary and wage claims</h2><p>Review payslips, differences, outstanding amounts and the documents supporting a claim.</p></div><span class="link-arrow">Salary claim guidance →</span></a>
<a class="card" href="/en/workplace-accidents"><div><span class="card-kicker">Workplace</span><h2>Workplace accidents</h2><p>Understand which facts, medical records and employment documents may need to be preserved.</p></div><span class="link-arrow">Workplace accident guidance →</span></a>
<a class="card" href="/en/business/employment-advice"><div><span class="card-kicker">Companies</span><h2>Employment advice for companies</h2><p>Preventive advice for contracts, discipline, conflicts, dismissals and recurring decisions.</p></div><span class="link-arrow">Business employment advice →</span></a>
</div></section>
<section class="section"><div class="container split"><div><span class="eyebrow">Fast first contact</span><h2>Have a deadline? Put the date at the top of your message.</h2></div><div class="prose"><p>For a dismissal, notification, unpaid amount or other time-sensitive matter, start with the exact date and the document you received. That makes the first review more useful.</p><p><a href="/en/contact">Contact the employment team →</a></p></div></div></section>
<CTA title="Not sure which employment service fits?" text="Explain what happened. We can start from the facts rather than from the name of the procedure." label="Contact the firm" />
</Layout>
